sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO Storage<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server<br/>HTTP

    Note over S3,HF: Flow 2 - Model Loading (startup)
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        S3->>HF: KServe storage initializer<br/>downloads model files<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
        Note over HF: Model loaded into memory<br/>(AutoModel* or GraniteCausalLM)<br/>CUDA auto-detected
    end

    Note over Orchestrator,BuiltIn: Flow 1 - Built-in Detection
    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>KServe auth
        Istio->>BuiltIn: Forward (mTLS STRICT)
        Note over BuiltIn: Registry lookup:<br/>regex → PII patterns<br/>file_type → schema validation<br/>custom → sandboxed user code
        BuiltIn-->>Istio: Detection results<br/>[{detection, detection_type,<br/>score, evidence}]
        Istio-->>Orchestrator: Response (mTLS)
    end

    Note over Orchestrator,HF: Flow 2 - HuggingFace Inference
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>KServe auth
        Istio->>HF: Forward (mTLS STRICT)
        Note over HF: PyTorch model inference<br/>(in-process)<br/>Threshold: configurable<br/>Per-label thresholds supported
        HF-->>Istio: Detection results<br/>[{detection, detection_type,<br/>score, evidence}]
        Istio-->>Orchestrator: Response (mTLS)
    end

    Note over Orchestrator,vLLM: Flow 3 - LLM Judge Evaluation
    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
        Orchestrator->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>KServe auth
        Istio->>Judge: Forward (mTLS STRICT)
        Judge->>vLLM: OpenAI-compatible API call<br/>Evaluation metric + content
        vLLM-->>Judge: LLM evaluation response
        Note over Judge: vllm_judge processes<br/>metric scores<br/>(safety, toxicity, etc.)
        Judge-->>Istio: Detection results<br/>[{detection, detection_type,<br/>score, evidence}]
        Istio-->>Orchestrator: Response (mTLS)
    end
